px\">(Who am I kidding I won't be the first.)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T05:55:02-08:00","id":426484,"title":"","content":"Is 'Advanced PDF' something only Kickstater backers get? Or is it a drivethrurpg release?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>IA","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/462-tchokes","name":"Tchokes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T06:03:54-08:00","id":426490,"title":"","content":"Tchokes: Werewolf 2nd ed wasn't Kickstarted. As I understand it, the advance PDF will be available on drivethrurpg; after a couple of weeks or so for people to look at it, point out errors etc, the updated pdf will be uploaded (and people with the advance PDF will get the updated version too, no need for rebuying or anything) and the POD options will then be made available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"ht